        "Content": "Coastal Cottage on c 0.44 acres"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Small in size, Big in Character\r\nCauseway Cottage  is a charming traditional style dwelling, c.50 sq. mts. in size, offering a unique and rare opportunity for the right buyer.\r\nBecause of its location, the potential for this modest property is enormous. \r\nThe property comprises of a Kitchen/Dining, Sitting Room, Downstairs WC, on the ground floor, open plan bedroom upstairs.\r\nOverlooking the State owned 98 heritage acre site at White's Marsh, which was  purchased for its high nature value for the protection of wetlands grasslands, and bird habitats, offering tranquility and convenience  in a beautiful natural setting. \r\n Clonakilty comprises two estuaries separated by Inchydoney Island. The northern area is Clonakilty Harbour with estuarine mud and sandflats. Cul de sac pool, an area of open water and reedbed, with a fringe of alder woodland, is part of this area. \r\nThe southern area is Muckross Strand, again an estuary with mainly sand flats. There are two areas of marsh with patches of exposed mud and marsh; White's Marsh and Clogheen Marsh lying to the north and west of Muckross Strand.\r\nThe whole area is designated as a Special Protection Area (SPA) due to the wintering birds found here, particularly Shelduck, Curlew, Black-tailed Godwit and Dunlin- a wildlife enthusiasts paradise\r\nAfter a busy day spent observing the habitat, stroll down to the world renowned Inchydoney Hotel with its golden sands and walks, stunning vistas at every turn, the waves are some of the best in the Country, or cycle across to Dunmore House Hotel to sample some of finest cuisine on offer.and savour the warm family welcomes extended to all visitors\r\nBecause of its size and location, Causeway Cottage could be an ideal \"hideaway \" or \"bolthole\"in which to relax and unwind.\r\nClonakilty everybody's favourite all year round destination is a 5 minute drive away, offering a wide selection of music venues, dining options, outdoor activities, Summer festivals etc.,\r\nCauseway Cottage is cosy and charming, \" a little house on the prairie \". Viewing are by appointment only.\r\nServices: Septic Tank, Mains Water"
      },
      {
